      "status": "PARTIAL",
      "chunk_id": "text_8",
      "quote": "We included studies if they were randomized control trials, they had an intervention arm as compared to placebo, and the end point of interest was clinical outcomes and mortality. ... To the best of our knowledge, this is the first meta-analysis and systematic review of remdesivir and control groups, which determines oxygen support status at day 1 and 14, any adverse events at day 14, and all-cause mortality at day 14.",
      "reason": "The manuscript reports some variables sought (study design, intervention vs placebo, clinical outcomes, mortality, oxygen support status, adverse events) but does not provide a comprehensive, clearly defined list of all other variables (e.g., participant characteristics, funding sources, detailed intervention characteristics) or formal definitions for these variables."
