      "status": "PRESENT",
      "chunk_id": "text_8",
      "quote": "A modified Delphi process was used to include studies and to ensure that our objective was identified in selected studies . [13] The a priori methods for conducting the Delphi process for meta-analyzing the clinical effectiveness are described in Figure 1.",
      "reason": "The authors report using a modified Delphi process (and provide Figure 1) as the method/tool used to determine inclusion/objectives for the review, indicating a cited tool for deciding which items/studies to include."
    }
  ],
  "confidence": 80
